				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body" aria-labelledby="firstHeading" data-mw-ve-target-container>
					<div class="vector-body-before-content">
							<div class="mw-indicators">
		</div>

						<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia</div>
						<div id="contentSub"><div id="mw-content-subtitle"></div></div>
						
					</div>
					
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr" data-mw-parsoid-version="0.24.0.0-alpha27" data-mw-html-version="2.8.0"><section data-mw-section-id="0" id="mwAQ"><div class="shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux" style="display:none" about="#mwt1" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Short description","href":"./Template:Short_description"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Punctuation used with Chinese characters"}},"i":0}}]}'>Punctuation used with Chinese characters</div><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt1"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_short_description"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Short_description_is_different_from_Wikidata"/></span>
<p class="mw-empty-elt" id="mwAw"><span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt2" id="mwBA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Use American English","href":"./Template:Use_American_English"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"February 2019"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Use_American_English_from_February_2019" about="#mwt2"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_Wikipedia_articles_written_in_American_English" about="#mwt2" id="mwBQ"/>
<span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt3" id="mwBg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Use dmy dates","href":"./Template:Use_dmy_dates"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"February 2019"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Use_dmy_dates_from_February_2019" about="#mwt3" id="mwBw"/></p>

<p id="mwCA"><b id="mwCQ">Chinese punctuation</b> is the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Punctuation" title="Punctuation" id="mwCg">punctuation</a> system used in writing of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_language" title="Chinese language" id="mwCw">Chinese</a>. The standard in all <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinophone" title="Sinophone" id="mwDA">Sinophone</a> regions, including <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mainland_China" title="Mainland China" id="mwDQ">mainland China</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan" title="Taiwan" id="mwDg">Taiwan</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hong_Kong" title="Hong Kong" id="mwDw">Hong Kong</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Singapore" title="Singapore" id="mwEA">Singapore</a>, are almost same. </p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwEQ" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwEg" aria-labelledby="History"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="History">History</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: History"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwEw">The earliest prototype of punctuation in Chinese can be found in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oracle_bone_script" title="Oracle bone script" id="mwFA">oracle bone script</a>. In <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guo_Moruo" title="Guo Moruo" id="mwFQ">Guo Moruo</a>'s work <i id="mwFg">General Anthology of Divination Inscriptions</i> (<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt4" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwFw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"卜辞通纂"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">卜辞通纂</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt4" id="mwGA"/>, a collection of oracle bone script, written in 1933<sup about="#mwt10" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-1" id="mwGQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwGg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHA">]</span></span></a></sup>), in the 430th text, it showed from left to right "<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt5" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwHQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"癸卯卜 癸丑卜 癸丑卜"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">癸卯卜 癸丑卜 癸丑卜</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt5" id="mwHg"/>" which has 2 lines between them. These lines help to make texts independent. In Eastern and Western <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Han_dynasty" title="Han dynasty" id="mwHw">Han Dynasty</a>, there were 13 punctuations observed in the sources. This proved that early Chinese had already started to use punctuations; however, due to a lot of reasons, e.g. ignorance from government, lack of standard system, punctuation is still not common-seen in old Chinese texts.<sup about="#mwt13" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-2" id="mwIA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwIQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIg">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIw">]</span></span></a></sup> This is the reason for students in Ancient Chinese that they had to learn <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt6" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwJA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-latn"},"2":{"wt":"ju dou"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="zh-Latn">ju dou</i></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt6" id="mwJQ"/> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters" about="#mwt7" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwJg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"p":{"wt":"jù dòu"},"s":{"wt":"句读"},"t":{"wt":"句讀"}},"i":0}}]}'>simplified Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt7">:</span><span about="#mwt7"> </span><span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt7"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>句读</span><span about="#mwt7">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters" title="Traditional Chinese characters" about="#mwt7">traditional Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt7">:</span><span about="#mwt7"> </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt7"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>句讀</span><span about="#mwt7">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt7">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt7">:</span><span about="#mwt7"> </span><i about="#mwt7" id="mwJw"><span lang="zh-Latn">jù dòu</span></i>), the skill of punctuating texts.<sup about="#mwt16" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-3"}}'><a href="#cite_note-3" id="mwKA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwKQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwKg">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwKw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwLA">Nonetheless, because Chinese texts were generally not transmitted with any punctuation, there are passages, even in famous texts, where the "correct" or intended punctuation are ambiguous.  As a result, the meaning of the text can also be ambiguous. For example, this passage "<span lang="zh" about="#mwt17" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwLQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"卒為善士則之野有眾逐虎"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>卒為善士則之野有眾逐虎</span>" in <i id="mwLg">Mencius</i> 7B "Wholeheartedly" (<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt18" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwLw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"孟子·盡心下"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">孟子·盡心下</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt18" id="mwMA"/>)  has been punctuated as "<span lang="zh" about="#mwt19" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"卒為善士。則之野。有眾逐虎。"},"l":{"wt":"Ultimately, he became a great gentleman. Thereupon he went to the countryside. There was a crowd in pursuit of a tiger"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>卒為善士。則之野。有眾逐虎。</span><span about="#mwt19">; </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt19">'</span><span about="#mwt19">Ultimately</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt19">'</span><span about="#mwt19">, </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt19">'</span><span about="#mwt19">he became a great gentleman. Thereupon he went to the countryside. There was a crowd in pursuit of a tiger</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt19">'</span>"; or as "<span lang="zh" about="#mwt20" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"卒為善。士則之。野有眾逐虎。"},"l":{"wt":"Ultimately, he became great. Gentlemen took him as a model. In the countryside there was a crowd in pursuit of a tiger."}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>卒為善。士則之。野有眾逐虎。</span><span about="#mwt20">; </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt20">'</span><span about="#mwt20">Ultimately</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt20">'</span><span about="#mwt20">, </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt20">'</span><span about="#mwt20">he became great. Gentlemen took him as a model. In the countryside there was a crowd in pursuit of a tiger.</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt20">'</span>"; or as "<span lang="zh" about="#mwt21" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"卒為善士則。之野。有眾逐虎。"},"l":{"wt":"Ultimately, he became a model for great gentlemen. He went to the countryside. There was a crowd in pursuit of a tiger."},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>卒為善士則。之野。有眾逐虎。</span><span about="#mwt21">; </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt21">'</span><span about="#mwt21">Ultimately</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt21">'</span><span about="#mwt21">, </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt21">'</span><span about="#mwt21">he became a model for great gentlemen. He went to the countryside. There was a crowd in pursuit of a tiger.</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt21">'</span>". The first was given by the Han dynasty scholar Zhao Qi (<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt22" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwNA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hant"},"2":{"wt":"趙岐"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hant">趙岐</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt22" id="mwNQ"/>) and was the traditional reading accepted by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Song_dynasty" title="Song dynasty" id="mwNg">Song</a> scholar <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zhu_Xi" title="Zhu Xi" id="mwNw">Zhu Xi</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qing_dynasty" title="Qing dynasty" id="mwOA">Qing</a> scholar <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jiao_Xun?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Jiao Xun (page does not exist)" about="#mwt23" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:LocalizedAttrs" class="new" id="mwOQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ill","href":"./Template:Ill"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Jiao Xun"},"2":{"wt":"zh"},"3":{"wt":"焦循"}},"i":0}}]}' data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Jiao Xun"]}}'>Jiao Xun</a><span class="noprint" style="font-size:85%; font-style: normal; " about="#mwt23" id="mwOg"><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/焦循" title="zh:焦循" class="extiw">zh</a><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></span>, etc. The second reading is favored by 13th-century scholars Liu Changshi (<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt24" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwOw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hant"},"2":{"wt":"劉昌詩"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hant">劉昌詩</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt24" id="mwPA"/>), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zhou_Mi_(scholar)" title="Zhou Mi (scholar)" id="mwPQ">Zhou Mi</a>, etc. The third reading is proposed by modern scholars Wang Changlin (2002, 64) as well as Qin Hualin &amp; Ling Yu (2005, 31).<sup about="#mwt25" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-4"}}'><a href="#cite_note-4" id="mwPg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwPw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQA">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p><p id="mwQg">

The reform of punctuation had already started in 1904, when <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yan_Fu" title="Yan Fu" id="mwQw">Yan Fu</a>, a prolific translator, suggested a system modelled after <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Languages_of_Europe" title="Languages of Europe" id="mwRA">European languages</a>, a proposition that eventually caught on when <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hu_Shih" title="Hu Shih" id="mwRQ">Hu Shih</a> and Wang Yuanfang presented a punctuated edition of <i id="mwRg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Water_Margin" title="Water Margin" id="mwRw">Water Margin</a></i> in 1920.<sup about="#mwt29" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5"}}'><a href="#cite_note-5" id="mwSA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwSQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSg">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSw">]</span></span></a></sup> The first book to be printed with modern punctuation was <i id="mwTA">Outline of the History of Chinese Philosophy</i> (<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt26" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwTQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hant"},"2":{"wt":"中國哲學史大綱"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hant">中國哲學史大綱</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt26" id="mwTg"/>) by Hu Shih, published in 1919.<sup about="#mwt32" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-6"}}'><a href="#cite_note-6" id="mwTw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwUA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUQ">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUg">]</span></span></a></sup></p><figure class="mw-default-size mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwUw"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Kuozhai.jpg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwVA"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Kuozhai.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Kuozhai.jpg/250px-Kuozhai.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/Kuozhai.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x" data-file-width="293" data-file-height="298" data-file-type="bitmap" height="254" width="250" class="mw-file-element" id="mwVQ"/></a><figcaption id="mwVg">Examples of handwritten punctuation (circles in red ink) at the bottom-right or -center of characters. From the <i id="mwVw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yongle_Encyclopedia" title="Yongle Encyclopedia" id="mwWA">Yongle Encyclopedia</a></i>.</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="mw-default-size mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwWQ"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:新国文泰坦尼克.jpg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwWg"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:新国文泰坦尼克.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/%E6%96%B0%E5%9B%BD%E6%96%87%E6%B3%B0%E5%9D%A6%E5%B0%BC%E5%85%8B.jpg/250px-%E6%96%B0%E5%9B%BD%E6%96%87%E6%B3%B0%E5%9D%A6%E5%B0%BC%E5%85%8B.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/%E6%96%B0%E5%9B%BD%E6%96%87%E6%B3%B0%E5%9D%A6%E5%B0%BC%E5%85%8B.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x" data-file-width="369" data-file-height="550" data-file-type="bitmap" height="373" width="250" class="mw-file-element" id="mwWw"/></a><figcaption id="mwXA">1912 textbook of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republic_of_China_(1912–1949)" title="Republic of China (1912–1949)" id="mwXQ">Republic of China</a>'s <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commercial_Press" title="Commercial Press" id="mwXg">Commercial Press</a> depicting the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinking_of_the_Titanic" title="Sinking of the Titanic" id="mwXw">sinking of the <i id="mwYA">Titanic</i></a>, with punctuation marks to the right of characters</figcaption></figure>
<p id="mwYQ">Since 2011, the use of punctuation in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mainland_China" title="Mainland China" id="mwYg">mainland China</a> is regulated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guobiao_standards" title="Guobiao standards" class="mw-redirect" id="mwYw">Chinese national standard</a> GB/T 15834–2011 "General rules for punctuation" (<span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt33" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwZA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"s":{"wt":"标点符号用法"},"p":{"wt":"biāodiǎn fúhào yòngfǎ"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>标点符号用法</span><span about="#mwt33">; </span><i about="#mwt33" id="mwZQ"><span lang="zh-Latn">biāodiǎn fúhào yòngfǎ</span></i>).<sup about="#mwt36" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:0_7-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":":0"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-:0-7"}}'><a href="#cite_note-:0-7" id="mwZg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwZw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwaA">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwaQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="2" id="mwag" aria-labelledby="List_of_punctuation"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="List_of_punctuation">List of punctuation</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: List of punctuation"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwaw">The table is based on GB/T 15834–2011 "General rules for punctuation", the document by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standardization_Administration_of_China" title="Standardization Administration of China" class="mw-redirect" id="mwbA">Standardization Administration of China</a>, mainland Chinese government.<sup about="#mwt37" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:0_7-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":":0"}}'><a href="#cite_note-:0-7" id="mwbQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwbg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwbw">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwcA">]</span></span></a></sup> If the difference exists in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hong_Kong" title="Hong Kong" id="mwcQ">Hong Kong</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan" title="Taiwan" id="mwcg">Taiwan</a>, or other <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinophone" title="Sinophone" id="mwcw">Chinese-speaking world</a>, it will be labeled out.</p>
<table class="wikitable" id="mwdA">
<caption id="mwdQ">Use of Chinese punctuations</caption>
<tbody id="mwdg"><tr id="mwdw"><th id="mweA">Punctuation</th>
<th id="mweQ">Chinese name</th>
<th id="mweg">English name</th>
<th id="mwew">Use</th>
<th id="mwfA">Example sentence</th></tr>
<tr id="mwfQ">
<td id="mwfg"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt38" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwfw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>。</span></td>
<td id="mwgA"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt39" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwgQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"句号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">句号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt39" id="mwgg"/></td>
<td id="mwgw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Full_stop" title="Full stop" id="mwhA">fullstop</a></td>
<td id="mwhQ">
<ol id="mwhg"><li id="mwhw">End of a sentence.</li>
<li id="mwiA">The sentence is <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Declarative_sentence" title="Declarative sentence" class="mw-redirect" id="mwiQ">declarative</a>; can also be used in the exclamational sentences or questions which have a more smooth tone.</li></ol></td>
<td id="mwig">
<ol id="mwiw"><li id="mwjA"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt40" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwjQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"这是一个句子。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>这是一个句子。</span></li>
<li id="mwjg"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt41" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwjw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"这对他来说是一个问题吗。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>这对他来说是一个问题吗。</span></li></ol></td></tr>
<tr id="mwkA">
<td id="mwkQ"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt42" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwkg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"，"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>，</span></td>
<td id="mwkw"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt43" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwlA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"逗号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">逗号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt43" id="mwlQ"/></td>
<td id="mwlg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Comma" title="Comma" id="mwlw">comma</a></td>
<td id="mwmA">
<ol id="mwmQ"><li id="mwmg">In the middle of a sentence to show the stop of tone.</li>
<li id="mwmw">Use after a long <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Subject_(grammar)" title="Subject (grammar)" id="mwnA">subject</a> or <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Object_(grammar)" title="Object (grammar)" id="mwnQ">object</a>.</li>
<li id="mwng">After the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vocative_case" title="Vocative case" id="mwnw">vocative part</a>, like calling of one's name.</li>
<li id="mwoA">If the object is before subject.</li>
<li id="mwoQ">Add a descriptive sentence of the subject, similar to English subordinate clause.</li></ol></td>
<td id="mwog">
<ol id="mwow"><li id="mwpA"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt44" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwpQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"因此，我需要你。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>因此，我需要你。</span></li>
<li id="mwpg"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt45" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwpw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"世界卫生组织和美国[[National Institutes of Health|国立卫生研究所]]，发表了以下的建议。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>世界卫生组织和美国<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Institutes_of_Health" title="National Institutes of Health">国立卫生研究所</a>，发表了以下的建议。</span></li>
<li id="mwqA"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt46" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwqQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"陈教授，您过来一下！"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>陈教授，您过来一下！</span></li>
<li id="mwqg"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt47" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwqw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"腹带鼠，我看到了！"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>腹带鼠，我看到了！</span></li>
<li id="mwrA"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt48" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwrQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"吉米·威尔士，[[Wikipedia|维基百科]]的创始人，来到了会场。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>吉米·威尔士，<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia" title="Wikipedia">维基百科</a>的创始人，来到了会场。</span></li></ol></td></tr>
<tr id="mwrg">
<td id="mwrw"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt49" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwsA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"、"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>、</span></td>
<td id="mwsQ"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt50" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwsg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"顿号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">顿号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt50" id="mwsw"/></td>
<td id="mwtA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enumeration_comma" title="Enumeration comma" class="mw-redirect" id="mwtQ">enumeration comma</a></td>
<td id="mwtg">
<ol id="mwtw"><li id="mwuA">Write a list of nouns.</li>
<li id="mwuQ">Write between the repeated words.</li>
<li id="mwug">Write a list with using <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_numerals" title="Chinese numerals" id="mwuw">Chinese numerals</a>.</li></ol>

<p id="mwvA"><em about="#mwt51" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwvQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Em","href":"./Template:Em"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"No use in"}},"i":0}}]}'>No use in</em>:</p>

<ol id="mwvg"><li id="mwvw">In numbers, if it is not an abbreviation of a number.</li>
<li id="mwwA">Between quotation marks.</li></ol></td>
<td id="mwwQ">
<ol id="mwwg"><li id="mwww"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt52" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwxA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"苹果、香蕉、西瓜和橙子都是水果。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>苹果、香蕉、西瓜和橙子都是水果。</span></li>
<li id="mwxQ"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt53" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwxg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"看呀、看呀！"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>看呀、看呀！</span></li>
<li id="mwxw"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt54" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwyA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"一、这缺乏法律依据 二、没有更早的判例"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>一、这缺乏法律依据 二、没有更早的判例</span></li></ol>

<p id="mwyQ">No:</p>

<ol id="mwyg"><li id="mwyw"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt55" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwzA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"一、九六零年"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>一、九六零年</span></li>
<li id="mwzQ"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt56" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwzg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"《哈姆雷特》《罗密欧与朱丽叶》都是莎士比亚的作品。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>《哈姆雷特》《罗密欧与朱丽叶》都是莎士比亚的作品。</span></li></ol></td></tr>
<tr id="mwzw">
<td id="mw0A"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt57" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw0Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"——"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>——</span></td>
<td id="mw0g"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt58" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw0w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"破折号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">破折号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt58" id="mw1A"/></td>
<td id="mw1Q"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dash" title="Dash" id="mw1g">em dash</a></td>
<td id="mw1w">
<ol id="mw2A"><li id="mw2Q">Showing the longer sound.</li>
<li id="mw2g">Add the explanation between two sentences.</li>
<li id="mw2w">Showing a transition.</li></ol></td>
<td id="mw3A">
<ol id="mw3Q"><li id="mw3g"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt59" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw3w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"啊——这真是太惊人了！"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>啊——这真是太惊人了！</span></li>
<li id="mw4A"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt60" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw4Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"那位先生——小明认识很多年的——在一家建筑公司上班。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>那位先生——小明认识很多年的——在一家建筑公司上班。</span></li>
<li id="mw4g"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt61" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw4w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"我的东西在这里——咦，去哪了？"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>我的东西在这里——咦，去哪了？</span></li></ol></td></tr>
<tr id="mw5A">
<td id="mw5Q"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt62" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw5g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"！"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>！</span></td>
<td id="mw5w"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt63" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw6A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"感叹号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">感叹号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt63" id="mw6Q"/></td>
<td id="mw6g"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exclamation_mark" title="Exclamation mark" id="mw6w">exclamation mark</a></td>
<td id="mw7A">End of an exclamory sentence.</td>
<td id="mw7Q"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt64" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw7g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"这真是太容易了！"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">这真是太容易了！</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt64" id="mw7w"/></td></tr>
<tr id="mw8A">
<td id="mw8Q"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt65" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw8g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"？"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>？</span></td>
<td id="mw8w"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt66" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw9A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"问号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">问号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt66" id="mw9Q"/></td>
<td id="mw9g"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Question_mark" title="Question mark" id="mw9w">question mark</a></td>
<td id="mw-A">End of a question.</td>
<td id="mw-Q"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt67" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw-g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"你真的看不懂吗？"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">你真的看不懂吗？</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt67" id="mw-w"/></td></tr>
<tr id="mw_A">
<td id="mw_Q"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt68" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw_g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"："}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>：</span></td>
<td id="mw_w"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt69" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"冒号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">冒号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt69" id="mwAQE"/></td>
<td id="mwAQI"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colon_(punctuation)" title="Colon (punctuation)" id="mwAQM">colon</a></td>
<td id="mwAQQ">
<ol id="mwAQU"><li id="mwAQY">Before a statement, a speech, a quotation.</li>
<li id="mwAQc">Summary of previous text.</li>
<li id="mwAQg">Before the word needed to explain.</li>
<li id="mwAQk">In a letter, archive, showing the speech of someone.</li></ol></td>
<td id="mwAQo">
<ol id="mwAQs"><li id="mwAQw"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt70" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQ0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"鲁迅先生说过：“横眉冷对千夫指，俯首甘为孺子牛。”"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>鲁迅先生说过：“横眉冷对千夫指，俯首甘为孺子牛。”</span></li>
<li id="mwAQ4"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt71" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQ8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"被告：陈小明 原告：陈大明 审判官：王磊明"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>被告：陈小明 原告：陈大明 审判官：王磊明</span></li>
<li id="mwARA"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt72" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"王莽：新朝的创造者。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>王莽：新朝的创造者。</span></li>
<li id="mwARI"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt73" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"彼得：我认为……"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>彼得：我认为……</span></li></ol></td></tr>
<tr id="mwARQ">
<td id="mwARU"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt74" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"；"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>；</span></td>
<td id="mwARc"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt75" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"分号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">分号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt75" id="mwARk"/></td>
<td id="mwARo"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semicolon" title="Semicolon" id="mwARs">semicolon</a></td>
<td id="mwARw">
<ol id="mwAR0"><li id="mwAR4">Use the stop between parallel sentences but a sentence is not finished yet.</li>
<li id="mwAR8">Showing the turning point in non-parallel sentences.</li>
<li id="mwASA">Show the segmentations in listing.</li></ol></td>
<td id="mwASE">
<ol id="mwASI"><li id="mwASM"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt76" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"在经济学上，这是可行的；但在逻辑学上，这是不可行的。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>在经济学上，这是可行的；但在逻辑学上，这是不可行的。</span></li>
<li id="mwASU"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt77" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"你说他聪明，但是他无法理解勾股定理的概念；你说他不聪明，他又能理解起诉书的内容。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>你说他聪明，但是他无法理解勾股定理的概念；你说他不聪明，他又能理解起诉书的内容。</span></li>
<li id="mwASc"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt78" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"一、我认同；二、小明不认同。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>一、我认同；二、小明不认同。</span></li></ol></td></tr>
<tr id="mwASk">
<td id="mwASo"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt79" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"（）"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>（）</span></td>
<td id="mwASw"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt80" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAS0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"括号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">括号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt80" id="mwAS4"/></td>
<td id="mwAS8"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bracket" title="Bracket" id="mwATA">parenthesis</a></td>
<td id="mwATE">
<ol id="mwATI"><li id="mwATM">Add extended description.</li></ol></td>
<td id="mwATQ"></td></tr>
<tr id="mwATU">
<td id="mwATY"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt81" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"……"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>……</span></td>
<td id="mwATg"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt82" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"省略号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">省略号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt82" id="mwATo"/></td>
<td id="mwATs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ellipsis" title="Ellipsis" id="mwATw">ellipsis</a></td>
<td id="mwAT0">
<ol id="mwAT4"><li id="mwAT8">For omission.</li></ol></td>
<td id="mwAUA"></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAUE">
<td id="mwAUI"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt83" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"“”"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>“”</span></td>
<td id="mwAUQ"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt84" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"双引号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">双引号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt84" id="mwAUY"/></td>
<td rowspan="4" id="mwAUc"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quotation_mark" title="Quotation mark" id="mwAUg">quotation mark</a></td>
<td id="mwAUk">General use.

<ol id="mwAUo"><li id="mwAUs">Quotation.</li>
<li id="mwAUw">Sarcasm of literal meaning.</li></ol></td>
<td id="mwAU0">
<ol id="mwAU4"><li id="mwAU8"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt85" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"他问道：“什么意思？”"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>他问道：“什么意思？”</span></li>
<li id="mwAVE"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt86" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"他真是一个“仁义”的人。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>他真是一个“仁义”的人。</span></li></ol></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAVM">
<td id="mwAVQ"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt87" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"‘’"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>‘’</span></td>
<td id="mwAVY"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt88" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"单引号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">单引号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt88" id="mwAVg"/></td>
<td id="mwAVk">Use within quotation mark.</td>
<td id="mwAVo"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt89" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"“请问，‘新自由主义’是什么意思？”"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>“请问，‘新自由主义’是什么意思？”</span></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAVw">
<td id="mwAV0"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt90" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAV4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"《》"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>《》</span></td>
<td id="mwAV8"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt91" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAWA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"书名号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">书名号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt91" id="mwAWE"/></td>
<td id="mwAWI">Use only for book titles.</td>
<td id="mwAWM"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt92" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAWQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"《[[Qiushi|求是]]》"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>《<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qiushi" title="Qiushi">求是</a>》</span></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAWU">
<td id="mwAWY"><b id="mwAWc"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt93" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAWg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"﹏﹏"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>﹏﹏</span></b></td>
<td id="mwAWk"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt94" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAWo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"書名號"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">書名號</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt94" id="mwAWs"/></td>
<td id="mwAWw">Non-standard form in mainland China. One of two standard forms in Taiwan<sup about="#mwt97" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-8" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-8"}}'><a href="#cite_note-8" id="mwAW0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAW4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAW8">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAXA">]</span></span></a></sup>.</td>
<td id="mwAXE"></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAXI">
<td id="mwAXM"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt98" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAXQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"·"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>·</span></td>
<td id="mwAXU"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt99" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAXY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"间隔号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">间隔号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt99" id="mwAXc"/></td>
<td id="mwAXg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_dot" title="Middle dot" id="mwAXk">middle dot</a></td>
<td id="mwAXo">
<ol id="mwAXs"><li id="mwAXw">For foreign, minority, to split the non-<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Han_Chinese" title="Han Chinese" id="mwAX0">Han</a> names. <em about="#mwt100" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAX4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Em","href":"./Template:Em"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Not in"}},"i":0}}]}'>Not in</em> quotation mark for book (《》) because of the use in 3.</li>
<li id="mwAX8">Splitting a date.</li>
<li id="mwAYA">In quotation mark for book (《》), it means the chapter.</li></ol></td>
<td id="mwAYE">
<ol id="mwAYI"><li id="mwAYM"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt101" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAYQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"约翰·道伊"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>约翰·道伊</span></li>
<li id="mwAYU"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt102" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAYY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"[[May Fourth Movement|五·四运动]]"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/May_Fourth_Movement" title="May Fourth Movement">五·四运动</a></span></li>
<li id="mwAYc"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt103" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAYg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"《圣经·新约·创世纪》"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>《圣经·新约·创世纪》</span></li></ol></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAYk">
<td id="mwAYo"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt104" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAYs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"&lt;ins>文&lt;/ins>"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh"><ins>文</ins></span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt104" id="mwAYw"/></td>
<td id="mwAY0"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt105" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAY4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"专名号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">专名号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt105" id="mwAY8"/></td>
<td id="mwAZA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proper_noun" title="Proper noun" id="mwAZE">proper noun</a> underline</td>
<td id="mwAZI">In mainland China, only use in old texts.</td>
<td id="mwAZM"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt106" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAZQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&lt;u>[[Confucius|孔子]]&lt;/u>，本名&lt;u>孔丘&lt;/u>，字&lt;u>仲尼&lt;/u>，&lt;u>鲁国&lt;/u>人也。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/><u><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Confucius" title="Confucius">孔子</a></u>，本名<u>孔丘</u>，字<u>仲尼</u>，<u>鲁国</u>人也。</span></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAZU">
<td id="mwAZY"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt107" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAZc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"字"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">字</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt107" id="mwAZg"/>
<p id="mwAZk"><code id="mwAZo">·</code></p></td>
<td id="mwAZs"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt108" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAZw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hans"},"2":{"wt":"着重号"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hans">着重号</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt108" id="mwAZ0"/></td>
<td id="mwAZ4">emphasis</td>
<td id="mwAZ8">Giving emphasis.</td>
<td id="mwAaA"></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p id="mwAaE">Marks imported from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Europe" title="Europe" id="mwAaI">Europe</a> are fullwidth instead of halfwidth like their original European counterparts, thus incorporating more space, and no longer need to be followed by an additional space in typesetting:<sup about="#mwt111" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-UFF00_9-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"UFF00"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-UFF00-9"}}'><a href="#cite_note-UFF00-9" id="mwAaM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAaQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAaU">[</span>9<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAaY">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt114" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-U3000_10-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"U3000"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-U3000-10"}}'><a href="#cite_note-U3000-10" id="mwAac"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAag"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAak">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAao">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<ul id="mwAas"><li id="mwAaw"><span class="nowrap" about="#mwt115" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAa0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"angbr","href":"./Template:Angbr"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"　"}},"i":0}}]}'><span typeof="mw:Entity">⟨</span>　<span typeof="mw:Entity">⟩</span></span> (U+3000 <style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r920966791" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt116" id="mwAa4" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH SPACE"}},"i":0}}]}'>.mw-parser-output span.smallcaps{font-variant:small-caps}.mw-parser-output span.smallcaps-smaller{font-size:85%}</style><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt116" id="mwAa8">FULLWIDTH SPACE</span>) is the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space_(punctuation)" title="Space (punctuation)" id="mwAbA">space</a>, but takes the width of a full <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_characters" title="Chinese characters" id="mwAbE">hanzi</a>.</li>
<li id="mwAbI">， (U+FF0C <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt118" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAbM" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH COMMA"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt118" id="mwAbQ">FULLWIDTH COMMA</span>) is the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Comma_(punctuation)" title="Comma (punctuation)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAbU">comma</a> (,). It cannot be used for enumerating a list; see "enumeration comma" below.</li>
<li id="mwAbY">！ (U+FF01 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt120" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAbc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH EXCLAMATION MARK"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt120" id="mwAbg">FULLWIDTH EXCLAMATION MARK</span>) is the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exclamation_mark" title="Exclamation mark" id="mwAbk">exclamation mark</a> (!).</li>
<li id="mwAbo">？ (U+FF1F <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt122" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAbs" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH QUESTION MARK"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt122" id="mwAbw">FULLWIDTH QUESTION MARK</span>) is the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Question_mark" title="Question mark" id="mwAb0">question mark</a> (?).</li>
<li id="mwAb4">； (U+FF1B <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt124" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAb8" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH SEMICOLON"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt124" id="mwAcA">FULLWIDTH SEMICOLON</span>) is the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semicolon" title="Semicolon" id="mwAcE">semicolon</a> (;).</li>
<li id="mwAcI">： (U+FF1A <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt126" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAcM" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH COLON"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt126" id="mwAcQ">FULLWIDTH COLON</span>) is the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colon_(punctuation)" title="Colon (punctuation)" id="mwAcU">colon</a> (:).</li>
<li id="mwAcY">（ ） (U+FF08 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt128" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAcc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH LEFT PARENTHESIS"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt128" id="mwAcg">FULLWIDTH LEFT PARENTHESIS</span>), (U+FF09 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt130" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAck" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH RIGHT PARENTHESIS"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt130" id="mwAco">FULLWIDTH RIGHT PARENTHESIS</span>) are <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bracket#Parentheses" title="Bracket" id="mwAcs">parentheses</a> (round brackets).</li>
<li id="mwAcw">There are two kinds of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bracket#Square_brackets" title="Bracket" id="mwAc0">square brackets</a>:
<ul id="mwAc4"><li id="mwAc8">［］ (U+FF3B <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt132" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAdA" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH LEFT SQUARE BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt132" id="mwAdE">FULLWIDTH LEFT SQUARE BRACKET</span>), (U+FF3D <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt134" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAdI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH RIGHT SQUARE BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt134" id="mwAdM">FULLWIDTH RIGHT SQUARE BRACKET</span>)</li>
<li id="mwAdQ">【 】 (U+3010 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt136" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAdU" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"LEFT BLACK LENTICULAR BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt136" id="mwAdY">LEFT BLACK LENTICULAR BRACKET</span>), (U+3011 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt138" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAdc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"RIGHT BLACK LENTICULAR BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt138" id="mwAdg">RIGHT BLACK LENTICULAR BRACKET</span>)</li></ul></li></ul>
<p id="mwAdk"><span class="anchor" id="Punctuations" about="#mwt140" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"anchor","href":"./Template:Anchor"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Punctuations"}},"i":0}}]}'></span>Other punctuation symbols are more different, in shape or usage:<sup about="#mwt141" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-U3000_10-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"U3000"}}'><a href="#cite_note-U3000-10" id="mwAdo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAds"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdw">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAd0">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt144" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-UFE30_11-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"UFE30"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-UFE30-11"}}'><a href="#cite_note-UFE30-11" id="mwAd4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAd8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeA">[</span>11<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeE">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwAeI" aria-labelledby="More_details"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="More_details">More details</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: More details"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwAeM" aria-labelledby="Period_(。)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Period_(。)"><span id="Period_.28.E3.80.82.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span><span class="anchor" id="Full_stop"></span>Period (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt145" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAeQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>。</span>)</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Period (。)"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwAeU"><dd id="mwAeY">The Chinese <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Full_stop" title="Full stop" id="mwAec">period</a> (U+3002 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt146" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAeg" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"IDEOGRAPHIC FULL STOP"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt146" id="mwAek">IDEOGRAPHIC FULL STOP</span>) is a fullwidth small circle (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters" about="#mwt148" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAeo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zh","href":"./Template:Zh"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"句號"},"p":{"wt":"jùhào"},"s":{"wt":"句号"},"l":{"wt":"sentence mark"}},"i":0}}]}'>simplified Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt148">:</span><span about="#mwt148"> </span><span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt148"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>句号</span><span about="#mwt148">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters" title="Traditional Chinese characters" about="#mwt148">traditional Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt148">:</span><span about="#mwt148"> </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt148"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>句號</span><span about="#mwt148">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt148">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt148">:</span><span about="#mwt148"> </span><i about="#mwt148"><span lang="zh-Latn">jùhào</span></i><span about="#mwt148">; </span><abbr title="Literal translation" about="#mwt148"><small>lit.</small></abbr><span about="#mwt148"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt148">'</span><span about="#mwt148">sentence mark</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt148">'</span>). In horizontal writing, the period is placed in the middle <span style="border: 1px dotted red;" id="mwAes"><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt149" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAew" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>。</span></span>, however in Mainland China it is placed in the bottom left <span style="border: 1px dotted red;" id="mwAe0"><span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt150" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAe4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"s":{"wt":"。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>。</span></span>; in vertical writing, it is placed below and to the right of the last character <span style="border: 1px dotted red;" id="mwAe8"><span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt151" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAfA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"s":{"wt":"︒"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>︒</span></span>(U+FE12 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt152" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAfE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"PRESENTATION FORM FOR VERTICAL IDEOGRAPHIC FULL STOP"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt152" id="mwAfI">PRESENTATION FORM FOR VERTICAL IDEOGRAPHIC FULL STOP</span>) in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mainland_China" title="Mainland China" id="mwAfM">Mainland China</a>, and in the middle <span style="border: 1px dotted red;" id="mwAfQ"><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt154" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAfU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"。"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>。</span></span> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan" title="Taiwan" id="mwAfY">Taiwan</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hong_Kong" title="Hong Kong" id="mwAfc">Hong Kong</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macau" title="Macau" id="mwAfg">Macau</a>.<sup about="#mwt155" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-U3000_10-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"U3000"}}'><a href="#cite_note-U3000-10" id="mwAfk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAfo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfs">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfw">]</span></span></a></sup></dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mwAf0" aria-labelledby="Quotation_marks_(「…」_,_﹁…﹂_,_“…”)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Quotation_marks_(「…」_,_﹁…﹂_,_“…”)"><span id="Quotation_marks_.28.E3.80.8C.E2.80.A6.E3.80.8D_.2C_.EF.B9.81.E2.80.A6.EF.B9.82_.2C_.E2.80.9C.E2.80.A6.E2.80.9D.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span><span class="anchor" id="Quotation_marks"></span>Quotation marks (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt156" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAf4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"「…」 , ﹁…﹂ , “…” "}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>「…」 , ﹁…﹂ , “…”</span>)</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Quotation marks (「…」 , ﹁…﹂ , “…”)"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwAf8"><dd id="mwAgA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese" title="Traditional Chinese" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAgE">Traditional Chinese</a> does <b id="mwAgI">not</b> use European quotation marks. Its double and single <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quotation_mark" title="Quotation mark" id="mwAgM">quotation marks</a> are fullwidth <span lang="zh" about="#mwt157" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAgQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"『 』"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>『 』</span> (U+300E <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt158" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAgU" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"LEFT WHITE CORNER BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt158" id="mwAgY">LEFT WHITE CORNER BRACKET</span>, U+300F <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt160" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAgc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"RIGHT WHITE CORNER BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt160" id="mwAgg">RIGHT WHITE CORNER BRACKET</span>) and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt162" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAgk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"「 」"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>「 」</span> (U+300C <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt163" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAgo" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"LEFT CORNER BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt163" id="mwAgs">LEFT CORNER BRACKET</span>, U+300D <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt165" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAgw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"RIGHT CORNER BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt165" id="mwAg0">RIGHT CORNER BRACKET</span>). The double quotation marks are used when embedded within single quotation marks: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt167" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAg4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"「…『…』…」"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>「…『…』…」</span>. In vertical text, quotation marks are rotated 90° clockwise (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt168" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAg8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"﹁…﹂"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>﹁…﹂</span> (U+FE41 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt169" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAhA" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"PRESENTATION FORM FOR VERTICAL LEFT ANGLE BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt169" id="mwAhE">PRESENTATION FORM FOR VERTICAL LEFT ANGLE BRACKET</span>, U+FE42 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt171" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAhI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"PRESENTATION FORM FOR VERTICAL RIGHT CORNER BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt171" id="mwAhM">PRESENTATION FORM FOR VERTICAL RIGHT CORNER BRACKET</span>)).<sup about="#mwt173" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-U3000_10-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"U3000"}}'><a href="#cite_note-U3000-10" id="mwAhQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhY">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhc">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt174" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-UFE30_11-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"UFE30"}}'><a href="#cite_note-UFE30-11" id="mwAhg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAho">[</span>11<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhs">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt176" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-12" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-12"}}'><a href="#cite_note-12" id="mwAhw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAh0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAh4">[</span>12<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAh8">]</span></span></a></sup></dd>
<dd id="mwAiA"></dd>
<dd id="mwAiE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese" title="Simplified Chinese" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAiI">Simplified Chinese</a> <b id="mwAiM">officially</b> prescribes European-style quotation marks for horizontal text and Chinese quotation marks for vertical text. Single quotation marks are used when embedded within double quotation marks: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt177" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAiQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"“…‘…’…”"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>“…‘…’…”</span>.</dd>
<dd id="mwAiU">These quotation marks are fullwidth in printed matter but share the same codepoints as the European quotation marks in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unicode" title="Unicode" id="mwAiY">Unicode</a>, so they require a Chinese-language font to be displayed correctly. In vertical text, corner brackets rotated 90° clockwise (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt178" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAic" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"﹃…﹁…﹂…﹄"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>﹃…﹁…﹂…﹄</span>), are used similar to Traditional Chinese but in reverse clamping order, with double quotation on the outside and single quotation on the inside. However, corner brackets are commonly encountered in situations that normally necessitate European punctuation, including in official contexts and media.<sup about="#mwt180" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-cn_13-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"cn"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-cn-13"}}'><a href="#cite_note-cn-13" id="mwAig"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAik"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAio">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAis">]</span></span></a></sup></dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mwAiw" aria-labelledby="Enumeration_comma_(、)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Enumeration_comma_(、)"><span id="Enumeration_comma_.28.E3.80.81.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span><span class="anchor" id="Enumeration_comma"></span>Enumeration comma (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt181" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAi0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"、"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>、</span>)</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Enumeration comma (、)"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwAi4"><dd id="mwAi8"><figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwAjA"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Yeli-Island-Plant-collecting-prohibited-0716.jpg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwAjE"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Yeli-Island-Plant-collecting-prohibited-0716.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Yeli-Island-Plant-collecting-prohibited-0716.jpg/250px-Yeli-Island-Plant-collecting-prohibited-0716.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Yeli-Island-Plant-collecting-prohibited-0716.jpg/500px-Yeli-Island-Plant-collecting-prohibited-0716.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="697" data-file-height="663" data-file-type="bitmap" height="238" width="250" class="mw-file-element" id="mwAjI"/></a><figcaption id="mwAjM">A sign in a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zhuhai" title="Zhuhai" id="mwAjQ">Zhuhai</a> park. Meaning: "It is strictly forbidden to grab flowers, fruits, or, leaves; or to dig roots or medical plants!"</figcaption></figure> The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enumeration_comma" title="Enumeration comma" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAjU">enumeration comma</a> (U+3001 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt182" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAjY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"IDEOGRAPHIC COMMA"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt182" id="mwAjc">IDEOGRAPHIC COMMA</span>) or "dun comma" (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters" about="#mwt184" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAjg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zh","href":"./Template:Zh"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"頓號"},"s":{"wt":"顿号"},"p":{"wt":"dùnhào"},"l":{"wt":"pause mark"}},"i":0}}]}'>simplified Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt184">:</span><span about="#mwt184"> </span><span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt184"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>顿号</span><span about="#mwt184">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters" title="Traditional Chinese characters" about="#mwt184">traditional Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt184">:</span><span about="#mwt184"> </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt184"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>頓號</span><span about="#mwt184">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt184">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt184">:</span><span about="#mwt184"> </span><i about="#mwt184"><span lang="zh-Latn">dùnhào</span></i><span about="#mwt184">; </span><abbr title="Literal translation" about="#mwt184"><small>lit.</small></abbr><span about="#mwt184"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt184">'</span><span about="#mwt184">pause mark</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt184">'</span>) must be used instead of the regular comma when separating words constituting a list.</dd>
<dd id="mwAjk">Chinese language does not traditionally observe the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/England" title="England" id="mwAjo">English</a> custom of a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serial_comma" title="Serial comma" id="mwAjs">serial comma</a> (the comma before conjunctions in a list), although the issue is of little consequence in Chinese at any rate, as the English "A, B, and C" is more likely to be rendered in Chinese as "<span lang="zh" about="#mwt185" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAjw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"A、B及C"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>A、B及C</span>" or more often as "<span lang="zh" about="#mwt186" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAj0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"A、B、C"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>A、B、C</span>", without any word for "and", see picture to the right.<sup about="#mwt187" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-U3000_10-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"U3000"}}'><a href="#cite_note-U3000-10" id="mwAj4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAj8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkA">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkE">]</span></span></a></sup></dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="7" id="mwAkI" aria-labelledby="Middle_dot_(·)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Middle_dot_(·)"><span id="Middle_dot_.28.C2.B7.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span><span class="anchor" id="Middle_dot"></span>Middle dot (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt188" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAkM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"·"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>·</span>)</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section: Middle dot (·)"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwAkQ"><dd id="mwAkU">Chinese uses a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interpunct" title="Interpunct" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAkY">middle dot</a> to separate characters in non-Han personal names, such as Tibetan, Uyghur, etc. For example Nur Bekri (<span title="Uyghur-language text" about="#mwt189" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAkc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ug"},"2":{"wt":"نۇر بەكرى"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="ug" dir="rtl">نۇر بەكرى</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Uyghur-language_text" about="#mwt189" id="mwAkg"/>), the name of a Chinese politician of Uyghur descent, is rendered as "<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt190" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAkk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-hant"},"2":{"wt":"努爾·白克力"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hant">努爾·白克力</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt190" id="mwAko"/>". "<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leonardo_da_Vinci" title="Leonardo da Vinci" id="mwAks">Leonardo da Vinci</a>" is often transcribed into <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mandarin_Chinese" title="Mandarin Chinese" id="mwAkw">Mandarin</a> as <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt191" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAk0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-hant"},"2":{"wt":"李奧納多・達・文西"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hant">李奧納多・達・文西</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt191" id="mwAk4"/>. The middle dot is also fullwidth in printed matter, while the halfwidth middle dot [·] is also used in computer input, which is then rendered as fullwidth in Chinese-language fonts.</dd>
<dd id="mwAk8"></dd>
<dd id="mwAlA">In Taiwan, the hyphenation point ([‧], U+2027 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt192" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAlE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"HYPHENATION POINT"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt192" id="mwAlI">HYPHENATION POINT</span>) is used instead for the same purpose.<sup about="#mwt197" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-U2000_14-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"U2000"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-U2000-14"}}'><a href="#cite_note-U2000-14" id="mwAlM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAlQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlU">[</span>14<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlY">]</span></span></a></sup> They can also be used to represent decimal points in Chinese. For example "3.5" becomes <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt194" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAlc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hant"},"2":{"wt":"「三‧五」"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hant">「三‧五」</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt194" id="mwAlg"/>.<sup about="#mwt200" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-15" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-15"}}'><a href="#cite_note-15" id="mwAlk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAlo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAls">[</span>15<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlw">]</span></span></a></sup></dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="8" id="mwAl0" aria-labelledby="Title_marks_(《…》,_〈…〉,_﹏﹏﹏)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Title_marks_(《…》,_〈…〉,_﹏﹏﹏)"><span id="Title_marks_.28.E3.80.8A.E2.80.A6.E3.80.8B.2C_.E3.80.88.E2.80.A6.E3.80.89.2C_.EF.B9.8F.EF.B9.8F.EF.B9.8F.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span><span class="anchor" id="Book_title_marks"></span>Title marks (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt201" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAl4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"《…》, 〈…〉, ﹏﹏﹏"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>《…》, 〈…〉, ﹏﹏﹏</span>)</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Title marks (《…》, 〈…〉, ﹏﹏﹏)"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt202" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAl8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"main","href":"./Template:Main"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" Chinese punctuation for proper nouns"}},"i":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1368532237" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt203" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:1.6em;margin-bottom:0.5em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote i{font-style:normal}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt202" id="mwAmA">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_punctuation_for_proper_nouns" title="Chinese punctuation for proper nouns">Chinese punctuation for proper nouns</a></div>
<dl id="mwAmE"><dd id="mwAmI">For titles of books, films, and so on, Simplified Chinese officially uses fullwidth double angle brackets<sup about="#mwt216" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-16" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-16"}}'><a href="#cite_note-16" id="mwAmM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAmQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmU">[</span>16<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmY">]</span></span></a></sup> <span lang="zh" about="#mwt204" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAmc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"《 》"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>《 》</span> (U+300A <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt205" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAmg" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"LEFT DOUBLE ANGLE BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt205" id="mwAmk">LEFT DOUBLE ANGLE BRACKET</span>, U+300B <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt207" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAmo" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"RIGHT DOUBLE ANGLE BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt207" id="mwAms">RIGHT DOUBLE ANGLE BRACKET</span>), and fullwidth single angle brackets <span lang="zh" about="#mwt209" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAmw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"〈 〉"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>〈 〉</span> (U+3008 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt210" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAm0" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"LEFT ANGLE BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt210" id="mwAm4">LEFT ANGLE BRACKET</span>, U+3009 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt212" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAm8" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"RIGHT ANGLE BRACKET"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt212" id="mwAnA">RIGHT ANGLE BRACKET</span>).</dd>
<dd id="mwAnE"></dd>
<dd id="mwAnI">The latter is used when embedded within the former: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt217" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAnM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"《…〈…〉…》"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>《…〈…〉…》</span>. Although <span lang="zh" about="#mwt218" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAnQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"﹏﹏﹏"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>﹏﹏﹏</span> (wavy underline, U+FE4F <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt219" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAnU" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"WAVY LOW LINE"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt219" id="mwAnY">WAVY LOW LINE</span>) is the officially prescribed title mark by Taiwan's Ministry of Education (especially for handwriting), when typing, square brackets <span lang="zh" about="#mwt221" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAnc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"【 】"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>【 】</span> and double quotation marks <span lang="zh" about="#mwt222" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAng" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"『 』"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>『 』</span> are also de facto used, if not prescribed by dictionaries in a manner akin to Korean and Japanese; Simplified Chinese often does likewise for song titles. In practice, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese" title="Traditional Chinese" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAnk">Traditional Chinese</a>, single title marks are also used for articles in or sections of a book, a rule that is also officially prescribed for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese" title="Simplified Chinese" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAno">Simplified Chinese</a>.</dd>
<dd id="mwAns"></dd>
<dd id="mwAnw">Furthermore, unsanctioned and alternate usage of Western or Chinese quotation marks is rather common, especially so for Chinese quotation marks in Traditional Chinese newspapers; this "unsanctioned practice" is also commonly found in Japanese and Korean.<sup about="#mwt223" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-U3000_10-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"U3000"}}'><a href="#cite_note-U3000-10" id="mwAn0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAn4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAn8">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt224" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-UFE30_11-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"UFE30"}}'><a href="#cite_note-UFE30-11" id="mwAoE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAoI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoM">[</span>11<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoQ">]</span></span></a></sup></dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwAoU" aria-labelledby="Ellipsis_(……)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Ellipsis_(……)"><span id="Ellipsis_.28.E2.80.A6.E2.80.A6.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span><span class="anchor" id="Ellipsis"></span>Ellipsis (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt225" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAoY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"……"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>……</span>)</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section: Ellipsis (……)"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwAoc"><dd id="mwAog">In Chinese, the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ellipsis" title="Ellipsis" id="mwAok">ellipsis</a> is written with six dots (not three) occupying the same space as two characters in the center of a line.<sup about="#mwt228" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-gbt15834_17-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"gbt15834"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-gbt15834-17"}}'><a href="#cite_note-gbt15834-17" id="mwAoo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAos"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAow">[</span>17<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAo0">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt231" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-18" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-18"}}'><a href="#cite_note-18" id="mwAo4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAo8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwApA">[</span>18<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwApE">]</span></span></a></sup></dd>
<dd id="mwApI">Unicode provides an explicitly centered <span class="nowrap" about="#mwt232" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwApM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"unichar","href":"./Template:Unichar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"22EF"},"2":{"wt":"Midline Horizontal Ellipsis"}},"i":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r886049734" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt233" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Mono/styles.css"}}'>.mw-parser-output .monospaced{font-family:monospace,monospace}</style><span class="monospaced">U+22EF</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span style="font-size:125%;line-height:1em" about="#mwt232"><span typeof="mw:Entity">⋯</span></span><span about="#mwt232"> </span><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1373397503" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt232" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Unichar/name/styles.css"}}'>.mw-parser-output .unichar-name{font-variant:small-caps;text-transform:lowercase;font-feature-settings:"onum"}</style><span class="unichar-name" about="#mwt232" id="mwApQ">MIDLINE HORIZONTAL ELLIPSIS</span> character<sup about="#mwt240" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-19" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-19"}}'><a href="#cite_note-19" id="mwApU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwApY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwApc">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwApg">]</span></span></a></sup> in addition to the inexplicit <span class="nowrap" about="#mwt235" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwApk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"unichar","href":"./Template:Unichar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"2026"},"2":{"wt":"Horizontal Ellipsis"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r886049734" about="#mwt236" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Mono/styles.css"}}'/><span class="monospaced">U+2026</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span style="font-size:125%;line-height:1em" about="#mwt235"><span typeof="mw:Entity">…</span></span><span about="#mwt235"> </span><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1373397503" about="#mwt235" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Unichar/name/styles.css"}}'/><span class="unichar-name" about="#mwt235" id="mwApo">HORIZONTAL ELLIPSIS</span> character.<sup about="#mwt243" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-20" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-20"}}'><a href="#cite_note-20" id="mwAps"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwApw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAp0">[</span>20<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAp4">]</span></span></a></sup></dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="10" id="mwAp8" aria-labelledby="Two-em_dash_(⸺)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Two-em_dash_(⸺)"><span id="Two-em_dash_.28.E2.B8.BA.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span><span class="anchor" id="Em_dash"></span>Two-em dash (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt244" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAqA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"⸺"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>⸺</span>)</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10" title="Edit section: Two-em dash (⸺)"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwAqE"><dd id="mwAqI">Similarly, the two-em dash (<span class="nowrap" about="#mwt245" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAqM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"unichar","href":"./Template:Unichar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"2E3A"},"2":{"wt":"TWO-EM DASH"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r886049734" about="#mwt246" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Mono/styles.css"}}'/><span class="monospaced">U+2E3A</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span style="font-size:125%;line-height:1em" about="#mwt245"><span typeof="mw:Entity">⸺</span></span><span about="#mwt245"> </span><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1373397503" about="#mwt245" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Unichar/name/styles.css"}}'/><span class="unichar-name" about="#mwt245" id="mwAqQ">TWO-EM DASH</span>) is written so that it occupies the space of two <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Em_dash" title="Em dash" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAqU">em dash</a> characters in the center of the line. There should be no breaking in the line.<sup about="#mwt250" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-gbt15834_17-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"gbt15834"}}'><a href="#cite_note-gbt15834-17" id="mwAqY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAqc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAqg">[</span>17<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAqk">]</span></span></a></sup> To represent the two-em dash character ([⸺]), one can write two consecutive em dashes ([——], U+2014 U+2014). Chinese <span title="English-language text" about="#mwt248" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAqo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"en"},"2":{"wt":"{{linktext|dash|}}"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="en"><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dash" title="wikt:dash" class="extiw">dash</a></span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_explicitly_cited_English-language_text" about="#mwt248" id="mwAqs"/> is <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters" title="Traditional Chinese characters" about="#mwt249" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAqw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zh","href":"./Template:Zh"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"破折號"},"p":{"wt":"pòzhéhào"},"first":{"wt":"t"},"c":{"wt":""},"s":{"wt":""},"l":{"wt":"Break/Fold Mark"}},"i":0}}]}'>Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt249">:</span><span about="#mwt249"> </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt249"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>破折號</span><span about="#mwt249">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt249">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt249">:</span><span about="#mwt249"> </span><i about="#mwt249"><span lang="zh-Latn">pòzhéhào</span></i><span about="#mwt249">; </span><abbr title="Literal translation" about="#mwt249"><small>lit.</small></abbr><span about="#mwt249"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt249">'</span><span about="#mwt249">Break/Fold Mark</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt249">'</span>.</dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="11" id="mwAq0" aria-labelledby="En_dash_(–)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="En_dash_(–)"><span id="En_dash_.28.E2.80.93.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span><span class="anchor" id="En_dash"></span>En dash (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt251" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAq4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"–"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>–</span>)</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11" title="Edit section: En dash (–)"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwAq8"><dd id="mwArA">When connecting two words to signify a range, Chinese generally uses an <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/En_Dash" title="En Dash" class="mw-redirect" id="mwArE">en dash</a> occupying the space of one character (e.g. <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt252" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwArI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hani"},"2":{"wt":"1月—7月"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hani">1月—7月</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt252" id="mwArM"/> "January to July", which can also be written 1月至7月, with the character 至 in place of the dash). A single em dash character or a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tilde" title="Tilde" id="mwArQ">tilde</a> may also be used.<sup about="#mwt255" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-w3c-clreq_21-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"w3c-clreq"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-w3c-clreq-21"}}'><a href="#cite_note-w3c-clreq-21" id="mwArU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwArY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwArc">[</span>21<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwArg">]</span></span></a></sup></dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="12" id="mwArk" aria-labelledby="Wave_dash_(～)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Wave_dash_(～)"><span id="Wave_dash_.28.EF.BD.9E.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span><span class="anchor" id="Wavy_dash"></span>Wave dash (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt256" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAro" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"～"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>～</span>)</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12" title="Edit section: Wave dash (～)"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwArs"><dd id="mwArw">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wave_dash" title="Wave dash" id="mwAr0">wave dash</a> (<span class="nowrap" about="#mwt257" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAr4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"unichar","href":"./Template:Unichar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"301C"},"2":{"wt":"WAVE DASH"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r886049734" about="#mwt258" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Mono/styles.css"}}'/><span class="monospaced">U+301C</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span style="font-size:125%;line-height:1em" about="#mwt257"><span typeof="mw:Entity">〜</span></span><span about="#mwt257"> </span><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1373397503" about="#mwt257" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Unichar/name/styles.css"}}'/><span class="unichar-name" about="#mwt257" id="mwAr8">WAVE DASH</span>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters" about="#mwt260" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAsA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zh","href":"./Template:Zh"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"浪紋"},"p":{"wt":"làng wén"},"first":{"wt":"ts"},"c":{"wt":""},"s":{"wt":"浪纹"},"l":{"wt":""}},"i":0}}]}'>simplified Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt260">:</span><span about="#mwt260"> </span><span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt260"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>浪纹</span><span about="#mwt260">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters" title="Traditional Chinese characters" about="#mwt260">traditional Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt260">:</span><span about="#mwt260"> </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt260"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>浪紋</span><span about="#mwt260">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt260">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt260">:</span><span about="#mwt260"> </span><i about="#mwt260" id="mwAsE"><span lang="zh-Latn">làng wén</span></i>) is used in the Chinese language to signify a numerical range (e.g. 5～20個字 "5 to 20 words"). Additionally, there is another Unicode character called the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halfwidth_and_fullwidth_forms" title="Halfwidth and fullwidth forms" id="mwAsI">fullwidth</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tilde" title="Tilde" id="mwAsM">tilde</a> (<span class="nowrap" about="#mwt261" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAsQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"unichar","href":"./Template:Unichar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"FF5E"},"2":{"wt":"FULLWIDTH TILDE"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r886049734" about="#mwt262" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Mono/styles.css"}}'/><span class="monospaced">U+FF5E</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span style="font-size:125%;line-height:1em" about="#mwt261"><span typeof="mw:Entity">～</span></span><span about="#mwt261"> </span><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1373397503" about="#mwt261" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Unichar/name/styles.css"}}'/><span class="unichar-name" about="#mwt261" id="mwAsU">FULLWIDTH TILDE</span>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters" title="Traditional Chinese characters" about="#mwt264" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAsY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zh","href":"./Template:Zh"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"全形波浪號"},"p":{"wt":"quán xíng bōlàng hào"},"first":{"wt":"t"},"c":{"wt":""},"s":{"wt":""},"l":{"wt":""}},"i":0}}]}'>Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt264">:</span><span about="#mwt264"> </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt264"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>全形波浪號</span><span about="#mwt264">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt264">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt264">:</span><span about="#mwt264"> </span><i about="#mwt264" id="mwAsc"><span lang="zh-Latn">quán xíng bōlàng hào</span></i>) which is often used as an alternative form of the wave dash symbol. The wave dash is more commonly but not exclusively used when the numbers are estimates (e.g. <a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/circa" title="wikt:circa" class="extiw" id="mwAsg">circa</a> dates and temperatures in weather forecasts).</dd>
<dd id="mwAsk">For the most part, however, the en dash and wavy dash are interchangeable; usage is largely a matter of personal taste or institutional style. Note that the wave dash ([〜]) and the fullwidth tilde ([～]) should not be confused with the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wavy_dash?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Wavy dash (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" id="mwAso" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Wavy dash"]}}'>wavy dash</a> character (<span class="nowrap" about="#mwt265" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAss" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"unichar","href":"./Template:Unichar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"3030"},"2":{"wt":"WAVY DASH"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r886049734" about="#mwt266" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Mono/styles.css"}}'/><span class="monospaced">U+3030</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span style="font-size:125%;line-height:1em" about="#mwt265"><span typeof="mw:Entity">〰</span></span><span about="#mwt265"> </span><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1373397503" about="#mwt265" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Unichar/name/styles.css"}}'/><span class="unichar-name" about="#mwt265" id="mwAsw">WAVY DASH</span>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters" about="#mwt268" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAs0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zh","href":"./Template:Zh"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"浪線"},"p":{"wt":"làng xiàn"},"first":{"wt":"ts"},"c":{"wt":""},"s":{"wt":"浪线"},"l":{"wt":""}},"i":0}}]}'>simplified Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt268">:</span><span about="#mwt268"> </span><span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt268"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>浪线</span><span about="#mwt268">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters" title="Traditional Chinese characters" about="#mwt268">traditional Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt268">:</span><span about="#mwt268"> </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt268"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>浪線</span><span about="#mwt268">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt268">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt268">:</span><span about="#mwt268"> </span><i about="#mwt268" id="mwAs4"><span lang="zh-Latn">làng xiàn</span></i>). In <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_punctuation" title="Japanese punctuation" id="mwAs8">Japanese</a>, the wavy dash is used as an emphatic form of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chōonpu" title="Chōonpu" id="mwAtA">katakana-hiragana prolonged sound mark</a>.</dd>
<dd id="mwAtE">In informal use (such as <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Texting" title="Texting" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAtI">texting</a>), wavy dashes are also used to indicate a prolonged vowel similar to informal English's repeated letters (e.g. <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt269" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hani"},"2":{"wt":"哇～～"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hani">哇～～</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt269" id="mwAtQ"/> "waaah") or to indicate stress in places where English would employ an emphatic tone marked variously by italics or bolding (e.g. <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt270" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hani"},"2":{"wt":"要～～"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hani">要～～</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt270" id="mwAtY"/> "I <i id="mwAtc">want</i> it!").<sup about="#mwt271" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-U3000_10-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"U3000"}}'><a href="#cite_note-U3000-10" id="mwAtg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAtk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAto">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAts">]</span></span></a></sup></dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="13" id="mwAtw" aria-labelledby="Spacing"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Spacing"><span class="anchor" id="mwAt0" data-x-id="Spacing"></span>Spacing</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13" title="Edit section: Spacing"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwAt4"><dd id="mwAt8">Similar to the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Letter-spacing" title="Letter-spacing" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAuA">spacing between letters</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kerning" title="Kerning" id="mwAuE">kerning</a>) in European languages, Chinese writing uses a very narrow space between characters, though it does not observe the equivalent to the wider <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space_(punctuation)" title="Space (punctuation)" id="mwAuI">space between words</a> except on rare occasions. Chinese<span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Entity" about="#mwt272" id="mwAuM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"snd","href":"./Template:Snd"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt272">–</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt272"> </span> particularly classical Chinese<span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Entity" about="#mwt273" id="mwAuQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"snd","href":"./Template:Snd"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt273">–</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt273"> </span> is thus a form of <i id="mwAuU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scriptio_continua" title="Scriptio continua" id="mwAuY">scriptio continua</a></i> and it is common for words to be split between lines with no marking in the text equivalent to the English <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyphen" title="Hyphen" id="mwAuc">hyphen</a>.</dd>
<dd id="mwAug"></dd>
<dd id="mwAuk">When a space is used, it is also fullwidth (U+3000 <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt274" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAuo" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"IDEOGRAPHIC SPACE"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt274" id="mwAus">IDEOGRAPHIC SPACE</span>: <span class="nowrap" about="#mwt276" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAuw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"angbr","href":"./Template:Angbr"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"　"}},"i":0}}]}'><span typeof="mw:Entity">⟨</span>　<span typeof="mw:Entity">⟩</span></span>).</dd>
<dd id="mwAu0"></dd>
<dd id="mwAu4">One instance of its usage is as an <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tai_tou" title="Tai tou" id="mwAu8">honorific marker</a>. A modern example in 20th century Taiwan, is found in the reference to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiang_Kai-shek" title="Chiang Kai-shek" id="mwAvA">Chiang Kai-shek</a> as <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt277" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"先&amp;zwnj;總&amp;zwnj;統　蔣&amp;zwnj;公"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">先<span typeof="mw:Entity">‌</span>總<span typeof="mw:Entity">‌</span>統　蔣<span typeof="mw:Entity">‌</span>公</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt277" id="mwAvI"/> (Former President, Lord Chiang), in which the preceding space serves as an honorific marker for <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt278" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Hant"},"2":{"wt":"蔣公"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Hant">蔣公</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt278" id="mwAvQ"/>. This use is also still current in very formal letters or other old-style documents,<sup about="#mwt279" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-U3000_10-7" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"U3000"}}'><a href="#cite_note-U3000-10" id="mwAvU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAvY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAvc">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAvg">]</span></span></a></sup> as well as religious scripture.</dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="14" id="mwAvk" aria-labelledby="Asterisk_(_*_)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Asterisk_(_*_)"><span id="Asterisk_.28_.2A_.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span><span class="anchor" id="Asterisk"></span>Asterisk ( <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt280" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"*"}},"i":0}}]}'><span typeof="mw:Entity">*</span><i lang="zh"></i></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt280" id="mwAvs"/> )</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14" title="Edit section: Asterisk ( * )"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwAvw"><dd id="mwAv0">Mainland Chinese supply chains often use an <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asterisk" title="Asterisk" id="mwAv4">asterisk</a> in place of a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multiplication_sign" title="Multiplication sign" id="mwAv8">multiplication sign</a> (×) to specify product dimensions. For example "10×200×350" becomes "10*200*350".</dd></dl>
<figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwAwA"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Battery-product-dimensions.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwAwE"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Battery-product-dimensions.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Battery-product-dimensions.png/250px-Battery-product-dimensions.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Battery-product-dimensions.png/500px-Battery-product-dimensions.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="705" data-file-height="161" data-file-type="bitmap" height="57" width="250" class="mw-file-element" id="mwAwI"/></a><figcaption id="mwAwM">Example of Chinese products using asterisks as punctuation for product dimensions</figcaption></figure>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="15" id="mwAwQ" aria-labelledby="Typographic_styles"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Typographic_styles">Typographic styles</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15" title="Edit section: Typographic styles"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAwU">The following are commonly suggested typographical styles; however, they are rarely carried out in practice and often only used when necessary. Proper name marks and title marks are primarily used in textbooks and official documents in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hong_Kong" title="Hong Kong" id="mwAwY">Hong Kong</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macau" title="Macau" id="mwAwc">Macau</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan" title="Taiwan" id="mwAwg">Taiwan</a>.</p>

<dl id="mwAwk"><dt id="mwAwo">Proper name mark ( <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt281" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAws" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"__"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="zh">__</i></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt281" id="mwAww"/> )</dt>
<dd id="mwAw0">A <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proper_name_mark" title="Proper name mark" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAw4">proper name mark</a> (an <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Underline" title="Underline" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAw8">underline</a>) is occasionally used, especially in teaching materials and some <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Film" title="Film" id="mwAxA">movie</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Subtitle_(captioning)" title="Subtitle (captioning)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAxE">subtitles</a>. When the text runs vertically, the appropriate name mark is written as a line to the characters' left (to the right in some older books).</dd>
<dt id="mwAxI">Title mark ( <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt282" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAxM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"﹏﹏"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="zh">﹏﹏</i></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt282" id="mwAxQ"/> )</dt>
<dd id="mwAxU">A <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Title_mark" title="Title mark" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAxY">title mark</a> is a wavy underline (<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt283" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAxc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"﹏﹏"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="zh">﹏﹏</i></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt283" id="mwAxg"/>, U+FE4F <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r920966791" about="#mwt284" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAxk" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sc","href":"./Template:Sc"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"WAVY LOW LINE"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="smallcaps " about="#mwt284" id="mwAxo">WAVY LOW LINE</span>) used instead of the regular book title marks whenever the proper noun mark is used in the same text.</dd>
<dt id="mwAxs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emphasis_point" title="Emphasis point" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAxw">Emphasis mark</a></dt>
<dd id="mwAx0">For emphasis, Chinese uses <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emphasis_point" title="Emphasis point" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAx4">emphasis marks</a> instead of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Italic_type" title="Italic type" id="mwAx8">italic type</a>. Each emphasis mark is a single dot placed under each character to be emphasized (for vertical text, the dot is placed to the right-hand side of each character). Although frequent in printed matter, emphasis marks are rare online, as most word processors do not support them. However, support in HTML has been possible by adding the CSS property <code id="mwAyA">text-emphasis-style</code>.</dd>
<dt id="mwAyE">Death-indication mark (<div style="display:inline-block;border-style: solid;padding: 3px;border-color: var(--border-color-emphasized, #000000);border-width: 2px;background-color: var(--color-inverted, #ffffff);color: var(--color-base, #000000);margin: 3px;" about="#mwt286" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAyI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"box","href":"./Template:Box"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"{{lang|zh|姓名}}"}},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Chinese-language text"><span lang="zh">姓名</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></div>)</dt>
<dd id="mwAyM">A death-indication mark (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters" about="#mwt287" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAyQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zh","href":"./Template:Zh"},"params":{"s":{"wt":"示亡号"},"t":{"wt":"示亡號"},"p":{"wt":"shìwánghào"}},"i":0}}]}'>simplified Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt287">:</span><span about="#mwt287"> </span><span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt287"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>示亡号</span><span about="#mwt287">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters" title="Traditional Chinese characters" about="#mwt287">traditional Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt287">:</span><span about="#mwt287"> </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt287"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>示亡號</span><span about="#mwt287">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt287">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt287">:</span><span about="#mwt287"> </span><i about="#mwt287" id="mwAyU"><span lang="zh-Latn">shìwánghào</span></i>) marks a person's recent death. Typographically, it consists of a black border around the person's name. It is supported by most word processors and is supported in CSS through the border property. It is used in lists or bibliographical data, for example. Lin Suifang (<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt288" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAyY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"林穗芳"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">林穗芳</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt288" id="mwAyc"/>) suggests that this practice may have entered the Chinese language in the fifties when it was supposedly adopted from translations from Russian; he does not cite any sources for this statement, however.<sup about="#mwt291" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-22" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-22"}}'><a href="#cite_note-22" id="mwAyg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAyk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAyo">[</span>22<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAys">]</span></span></a></sup></dd></dl>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="16" id="mwAyw" aria-labelledby="Apostrophe"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Apostrophe">Apostrophe</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16" title="Edit section: Apostrophe"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAy0">There is no equivalent of the apostrophe in Chinese. Therefore, it is omitted in translated foreign names such as "<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/O'Neill_(surname)" title="O'Neill (surname)" id="mwAy4">O'Neill</a>". Likewise, the hyphen is used only when writing translated foreign names with hyphens. Otherwise, it is not used in Chinese and is omitted when translating compound words.</p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="17" id="mwAy8" aria-labelledby="See_also"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="See_also">See also</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_punctuation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17" title="Edit section: See also"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
